# Wireframe: Issue Card

## Purpose & Flow Context

The Issue Card displays issue summary with real-time status and assignee updates via optimistic updates. Entry: user views issue list. Exit: user clicks card to navigate to issue detail.

---

## Notation Legend

| Symbol | Meaning | Symbol | Meaning |
|--------|---------|--------|---------|
| `[...]` | Button / interactive element | `[>...▼]` | Dropdown |
| `_______` | Text input / editable field | `[X]` | Close / dismiss |
| `⚠` | Warning / due date | `📎N` | N attachments |
| `💬N` | N comments | `🔗` | Card relationship |
| `👤` | User / mention | `○ ●` | Radio unselected / selected |

## Accessibility — Shared Conventions

All interactive screens inherit these. Per-screen specifics noted where they diverge.

| Concern | Convention |
|---------|------------|
| Landmarks | `header`, `main`, `aside`, `contentinfo` |
| Heading order | One `h1` per screen, `h2` for sections |
| Accessible names | Icon-only controls get `aria-label` |
| Keyboard | Tab, Enter/Space, Escape, Arrow keys |
| Target size | ≥24×24 CSS px reservation |
| Non-color intent | Icon + text, never color alone |

---

## Layout Regions

**Grid**: Issue card is part of issue list grid layout.

**App-shell**: Issue card is within main content area.

| Region | Content | Notes |
|--------|---------|-------|
| Issue Card | Status icon, title, priority, assignee, labels | Clickable card, hover state |

```
+------------------------------------------------------------------+
|  ○  Fix login timeout issue        [👤] [🔧]                    |
|     BUG  🔴 Urgent  💬3  📎1                                     |
+------------------------------------------------------------------+
```

*Legend: [{Button}] [Input] [Link] [#Heading] [>Dropdown] [Avatar] [Icon]*

## Components & Affordances

| Element | DS Component | Behavior | Edge Cases |
|---------|-------------|----------|------------|
| Status Icon | StatusCycleIndicator | Shows issue status, cycles on 'S' key press | Pulse animation during optimistic |
| Issue Title | Text | Click navigates to issue detail | Truncates with ellipsis if too long |
| Priority Icon | Icon | Shows issue priority level | None |
| Assignee Avatar | Avatar | Shows assigned user | Click opens assignee selector |
| Labels | Label chips | Shows issue labels | Horizontal scroll if too many |

## Data Display

Issue cards are displayed in a list or grid layout. Each card shows:
- Status (color-coded dot)
- Title (truncated)
- Priority (icon)
- Assignee (avatar)
- Labels (colored chips)
- Comment count (💬N)
- Attachment count (📎N)

## Content & Microcopy Intent

| Slot | Intent | Notes |
|------|--------|-------|
| Status Icon | Communicates issue status | Color-coded dot with label |
| Issue Title | Describes the issue | User-friendly language |
| Priority Icon | Shows urgency level | 🔴 Urgent, 🟡 High, 🔵 Medium, ⚪ Low |
| Assignee Avatar | Shows who is responsible | User avatar or initials |
| Labels | Categorizes the issue | Bug, Feature, Enhancement, etc. |

## States

### Idle (Default)

Card shows issue with normal styling.

```
+------------------------------------------------------------------+
|  ○  Fix login timeout issue        [👤] [🔧]                    |
|     BUG  🔴 Urgent  💬3  📎1                                     |
+------------------------------------------------------------------+
```

### Optimistic (Status Change)

Card shows pulse animation on status field, new value displayed immediately.

```
+------------------------------------------------------------------+
|  ●  Fix login timeout issue        [👤] [🔧]                    |
|     BUG  🔴 Urgent  💬3  📎1                                     |
+------------------------------------------------------------------+
  (status dot has pulse animation)
```

### Confirmed (Update Complete)

Card shows brief green flash on updated field, then returns to normal.

```
+------------------------------------------------------------------+
|  ●  Fix login timeout issue        [👤] [🔧]                    |
|     BUG  🔴 Urgent  💬3  📎1                                     |
+------------------------------------------------------------------+
  (status dot had brief green flash)
```

### Reverted (Update Failed)

Card shows flash red on reverted field, returns to original value.

```
+------------------------------------------------------------------+
|  ○  Fix login timeout issue        [👤] [🔧]                    |
|     BUG  🔴 Urgent  💬3  📎1                                     |
+------------------------------------------------------------------+
  (status dot had brief red flash, reverted to original)
```

## Responsive

| Breakpoint | Changes |
|------------|---------|
| Desktop (>1024px) | Full card layout with all elements |
| Tablet (768-1024px) | Compact layout, some elements may stack |
| Mobile (<768px) | Minimal layout, priority and labels may hide |

## Accessibility — Screen Composition

| Concern | Implementation |
|---------|----------------|
| Landmarks | Card is within main landmark |
| Heading order | Card title is h3 within article |
| Reading / Focus order | Tab to card, Enter/Space navigates to issue |
| Accessible names | Card: aria-label="Issue: {title}, Status: {status}, Priority: {priority}" |
| Keyboard operability | Tab to card, Enter/Space navigates, 'S' key cycles status |
| Target size | ≥24×24 CSS px on entire card |
| Focus not obscured | Card focus ring visible |
| Non-color intent | Status dot + label text, not just color |
